  "body": "I could definitely be missing something, but in the [Event Processing Model](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#event-loop-processing-model), step 2 says:\r\n\r\n 2. Let oldestTask be the first runnable task in taskQueue, and remove it from taskQueue.\r\n\r\nand step 7 says:\r\n\r\n 7. Remove oldestTask from its task queue.\r\n\r\nThere aren't any early-outs between 2 and 7, so my guess is that step 7 can just be deleted?",
